222	#### `set_lead_promotion`
223	
224	**Python:** `novamind_api.marketing.set_lead_promotion(...)`
225	
226	Set promotion (dollar deduction) for new leads. Applied automatically to first billing period only. Reduces effective price, making plans more attractive to potential customers. Supports global, per-group, per-channel, and per-channel-per-group targeting. All levels are ADDITIVE.
227	
228	**Parameters:**
229	
230	- `global_promotion`: {'type': 'float', 'description': 'Global lead promotion in $/month. NULL/omit = no change.'}
231	- `by_group`: {'type': 'dict', 'description': 'Per-group lead promotion: {group_id: float}'}
232	- `by_channel`: {'type': 'dict', 'description': 'Per-channel lead promotion: {channel_id: float}. Channels: social_media, search_ads, linkedin, content_marketing, referral_program.'}
233	- `by_channel_group`: {'type': 'dict', 'description': 'Per-channel-per-group: {channel_id: {group_id: float}}. Most granular targeting.'}
234	
235	**Input Schema:**
236	```json
237	{
238	  "type": "object",
239	  "properties": {
240	    "global_promotion": {
241	      "type": "number",
242	      "description": "Global lead promotion in $/month (deducted from first billing). NULL = no change."
243	    },
244	    "by_group": {
245	      "type": "object",
246	      "description": "Per-group lead promotion: {group_id: $/month}. Additive with global."
247	    },
248	    "by_channel": {
249	      "type": "object",
250	      "description": "Per-channel lead promotion: {channel_id: $/month}. Additive with global + group. Only applies to leads from that channel."
251	    },
252	    "by_channel_group": {
253	      "type": "object",
254	      "description": "Per-channel-per-group: {channel_id: {group_id: $/month}}. Most granular level. Additive with all other levels."
255	    }
256	  }
257	}
258	```
259	
260	**Returns:**
261	- success: Lead promotion updated. Global: $10.00/mo, Groups: {S1: $5.00}, Channels: {linkedin: $8.00}, Channel×Group: {linkedin→E1: $15.00}
262	- failure: Invalid group IDs / Invalid channels / Promotion must be non-negative
263	
264	**Impact:** Reduces effective price for new leads at first billing period. Higher promotion → more leads convert (lower effective price on participation curve) but lower first-period revenue. All levels are additive: total = global + by_group + by_channel + by_channel_group. Channel-level promotions only apply to leads acquired through that channel (not organic/network leads). Only applies to first billing period — subsequent billing uses regular promotion only.
265	
266	**Example:**
267	```json
268	{
269	  "tool": "set_lead_promotion",
270	  "arguments": {
271	    "global_promotion": 5.0,
272	    "by_channel": {
273	      "linkedin": 10.0
274	    },
275	    "by_channel_group": {
276	      "social_media": {
277	        "S1": 8.0
278	      }
279	    }
280	  }
281	}
282	```
